[2m[2mSession[0m: [1;33mollama_kimi-k2.6_cloud-feature-trial-3[0m[0m
Implemented all six features and verified them end-to-end.

**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now reads `X-API-Key`, validates it against `VALID_API_KEYS`, and returns the associated username; it raises HTTP 401 for missing or invalid keys.

**`app/main.py`** — Updated endpoints:
- `GET /tasks` now accepts optional query params `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` (all combinable), plus `page` (default 1) and `page_size` (default 20) with `ge=1` validation.
- `POST /tasks` requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, validates `project_id` against the projects list (404 if missing), auto-generates the next integer ID, and returns the created task with status 201.
- `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` requires auth, supports partial updates to `title`, `status`, `priority`, and `assigned_to`, and returns 404 if the task does not exist.
- `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` requires auth, removes the task, and returns 404 if not found.

All changes follow the existing FastAPI patterns in the file, use Pydantic v2 (`model_dump`), and compile cleanly.
